backend/runs*/
# Benchmark images are licence-restricted (see backend/benchmark/images/ATTRIBUTION.md);
# the runtime needs only manifest.csv and results/
backend/benchmark/images/

# Nested build output / caches (bare names above only match the context root)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
backend/tests/
